WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.835 --> 00:00:08.955
Your child's teacher has invited you to follow along in Fixer Nation Education. This video shows how to accept, and what you'll see.

2
00:00:09.456 --> 00:00:19.876
Open the email, and select the link. It works for fourteen days. The invitation is tied to the email address it was sent to, so use that same address.

3
00:00:20.379 --> 00:00:32.329
If you're new, you'll see your child's name at the top, and your email filled in. Enter your first name, last name, and a password with at least eight characters, and type the password again.

4
00:00:32.831 --> 00:00:35.871
Select Create Account and Accept Invitation.

5
00:00:36.374 --> 00:00:48.414
If you already have an account, you'll sign in and accept instead. If you're signed in with a different email, you'll be asked to sign out first, because the invitation belongs to the address it was sent to.

6
00:00:48.915 --> 00:00:59.045
After that, you're taken to the Parent Portal. Select Go to the Parent Portal. Next time, sign in from the Parent Login page, with your email and password.

7
00:00:59.546 --> 00:01:10.576
Your child is listed with their class. Each assigned lesson shows a label: Completed, In progress, or Not started. If the teacher set a due date, it shows here too.

8
00:01:11.077 --> 00:01:23.907
Select View resources on a lesson to see an overview, the objectives, the materials, and videos. You can also download the teacher copy, the student handout, and the classroom poster when they're available.

9
00:01:24.408 --> 00:01:32.358
You'll see whether lessons are done, but not quiz answers or your child's writing. That stays between your child and their teacher.
